hadiths[82]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1523","[AI-translation] ´Wasila bin al-Asqa raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne Isma'eel alaihissalam ki aulad mein se Kinana ko chuna aur Quraish ko Kinana mein se aur Bani Hashim ko Quraish mein se aur mujhe Bani Hashim mein se chuna "
"1524","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein qayamat ke din Adam ki aulad ka sardar hun ga aur sab se pehle meri qabr phate gi aur mein sab se pehle shafaat karun ga aur sab se pehle meri hi shafaat qabool ho gi "
"1525","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : us ki misaal jo Allah ne mujhe hidayat aur ilm diya aisi hai jaisay zameen par barish barasi aur us (zameen) mein kuch hissa aisa tha jis ne pani ko choos liya aur chaara aur bohat sa sabza ugaya aur us ka kuch hissa kara sakht tha us ne pani ko jama rakha phir Allah Taala ne us (pani) se logon ko faida pahunchaya ke unhon ne us mein se piya pilaya aur charaaya aur us ka kuch hissa chateel maidaan hai ke na to pani ko rokay aur na ghaas ugaye (jaisay chikni chataan ke pani laga aur chal diya) to ye us ki misaal hai ke jis ne Allah ke deen ko samjha aur Allah ne us ko us cheez se faida diya jo mujhe ataa farmayi us ne Aap bhi jana aur doosron ko bhi sikhaya aur jis ne us taraf sar na uthaya (yani tawajjuh na ki) aur Allah ki hidayat ko jis ko mein de kar bheja gaya qabool na kiya "
"1526","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : meri misaal aur mere deen ki misaal jo ke Allah ne mujhe de kar bheja hai aisi hai jaisay us shakhs ki misaal jo apni qaum ke paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae meri qaum ! mein ne lashkar ko apni donon aankhon se dekha hai (yani dushman ki fauj ko) aur mein saaf saaf darranay wala hun pas jaldi bhaago ab us ki qaum mein se baaz ne us ka kehna maana aur wo shaam hotay hi bhaag gaye aur aaraam se chalay gaye aur baaz ne jhutlaya aur wo subah tak us thikanay mein rahay aur subah hotay hi lashkar un par toot para aur un ko tabah kiya aur jar se ukhair diya pas yehi us shakhs ki misaal hai jis ne meri itaat ki aur jo kuch mein le kar aaya hun us ki ittiba ki aur jis ne mera kehna na maana aur sache deen ko jhutlaya "
"1527","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : meri aur doosray paighambaron ki misaal jo ke mere se pehle ho chukay hain aisi hai jaisay kisi shakhs ne ghar banaya aur us ki zeebaayish aur aaraayish ki lekin us ke kaunon mein se aik konay mein aik eent ki jagah chhor di pas log us ke gird phirnay lagay aur unhein wo imaarat pasand aayi aur wo kehnay lagay ke ye to ne aik eent yahan kyun na rakh di gayi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein wo eent hun aur mein Khaatam ul Ambiya hun "
"1528","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein us pathar ko pehchanta hun jo Makka mein hai wo mujhe nabuwwat se pehle salam kiya karta tha mein us ko ab bhi pehchanta hun "
"1529","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab (muqaam) Zaura mein thay { aur Zaura Madina mein masjid aur bazaar ke qareeb aik muqaam hai } Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pani ka aik pyala mangwaya aur apni hatheeli us mein rakh di to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ungliyon ke darmiyan se pani phootnay laga aur tamam ashaab raziyallahu anhum ne wuzu kar liya Qatada ne kaha ke mein ne Anas raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke Ae Hamza ! us waqt Aap kitnay aadmi hun ge Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke teen sau ke qareeb thay "
"1530","[AI-translation] ´Muaz bin Jabal raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham ghazwa Tabook ke mauqa par Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath us saal niklay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us safar mein do namazon ko jama kartay thay pas Zohar aur Asr donon mila kar padhein aur Maghrib aur Isha mila kar padhein aik din Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz mein dair ki phir niklay aur Zohar aur Asr mila kar padhein phir andar chalay gaye phir us ke baad niklay to Maghrib aur Isha mila kar padhein us ke baad farmaya ke kal tum log agar Allah Taala ne chaha to Tabook ke chashmay par pahuncho ge aur din nikalnay se pehle nahi pahunch sako ge aur jo koi tum mein se us chashmay ke paas jaye to us ke pani ko haath na lagao jab tak mein na aaun Muaz raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke phir ham us chashmay par pahunche aur ham se pehle wahan do aadmi pahunch gaye thay chashma ke pani ka ye haal tha ke joti ke tasma ke barabar ho ga wo bhi aahista aahista beh raha tha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un donon aadmiyon se poocha ke tum ne us ke pani mein haath lagaya unhon ne kaha ke haan to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko bura kaha (us liye ke unhon ne hukm ke khilaf kiya tha) aur Allah Taala ko jo manzoor tha wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko sunaya phir logon ne challuon se thora thora pani aik bartan mein jama kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne donon haath aur munh us mein dhoya phir wo pani us chashma mein daal diya to wo chashma josh maar kar banay laga aur logon ne (apne janwaron aur aadmiyon ko) pani pilana shuru kiya us ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Muaz ! agar teri zindagi rahi to to dekhay ga ke us (chashmay) ka pani baaghon ko bhar de ga (ye bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka aik bara muajiza tha us lashkar mein tees hazaar aadmi thay aur aik riwayat mein hai ke satr hazaar aadmi thay) "
"1531","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se khana talab kar raha tha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko aadha wasq jo diye (aik wasq saath sa ka hota hai) phir wo shakhs us ki biwi aur mehmaan hamesha us mein khatay rahay yahan tak ke us shakhs ne us ko maapa phir wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar to us ko na maapta to hamesha us mein se khatay aur wo aisa hi rehta (kyunke un se Allah Taala ka bharosa jata raha aur besabri zaahir hui phir barkat kahan rahay gi)"
"1532","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab (Madina ke gird) Khandaq khodi gayi to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bhooka paya mein apni biwi ke paas lota aur kaha ke tere paas kuch hai kyunke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bohat bhooka paya hai us ne aik thaila nikala jis mein aik sa jo thay aur hamaray paas bakri ka pila hua bacha tha mein ne us ko zabah kiya aur meri aurat ne aata paisa wo bhi mere saath hi farigh hui mein ne us ka gosht kaat kar haandi mein daalnay us ke baad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas palatnay laga to aurat boli ke mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saathiyon ke saamnay ruswa na karna (kyunke khana thora hai kahein bohat se aadmiyon ki dawat na kar dena) mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur chupkay se arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein ne aik bakri ka bacha zabah kiya hai aur aik sa jo ka aata jo hamaray paas tha tayyar kiya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chand logon ko apne saath le kar tashreef layie ye sun kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pukara aur farmaya ke Ae Khandaq walo ! Jabir ne tumhari dawat ki hai to challu aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke apni haandi ko mat utaarna aur aatay ki roti mat pakkana jab tak mein na aa jaun phir mein ghar mein aaya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi tashreef laaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aagay aagay thay aur log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay thay mein apni aurat ke paas aaya wo boli ke to hi pareshaan ho ga aur log tujhe hi bura kahein ge mein ne kaha ke mein ne to wohi kiya jo to ne kaha tha (lekin Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ailaan kar diya aur sab ko dawat suna di) mein ne wo aata nikala to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna lab mubarak us mein daalnay aur barkat ki dua ki phir hamari haandi ki taraf chalay aur us mein bhi thooka aur barkat ki dua ki us ke baad (meri aurat se) farmaya ke aik roti pakanay wali aur bila le jo tere saath mil kar pakaye aur haandi mein se doi nikaal kar nikaalti ja us ko utaarna mat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath aik hazaar aadmi thay pas mein qasam khata hun ke sab ne khaya yahan tak ke chhor diya aur laut gaye aur haandi ka wohi haal tha ubal rahi thi aur aata bhi waisa hi tha us ki rotiaan bin rahi thin "
"1533","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath aik sau tees aadmi thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya kisi paas khana hai aik shakhs ke paas aik sa anaaj nikla ya thora kam ya zyada phir wo sab gondha gaya phir aik mushrik aaya jis ke baal bikhray hue thay lamba bakriyan le kar haankta hua Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas pahuncha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to (bakri) baichta hai ya hadiya deta hai us ne kaha ke nahi baichta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se aik bakri khareedi to us ka gosht tayyar kiya gaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ki kalaiji bhoonnay ka hukm diya rawi ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam un aik sau tees aadmi mein se koi na raha jis ke liye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us kalaiji mein se kuch juda na kiya ho agar wo maujood tha to us ko de diya aur (agar maujood na tha to) us ka hissa rakh diya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne do pyaalon mein gosht nikala phir ham sab ne un mein se khaya aur sair ho gaye balke pyaalon mein kuch bach raha us ko mein ne oont par laad liya ya aisa hi kaha (us hadees mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke do mu'jizay hain aik to kalaiji mein barkat aur doosray bakri mein barkat) "
"1534","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` ashaab Suffa mohtaaj log thay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik baar farmaya ke jis ke paas do aadmiyon ka khana ho wo teen ko le jaye aur jis ke paas chaar ka ho wo paanchwin ya chhatay ko bhi le jaye aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) teen aadmiyon ko le aaye aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam das aadmiyon ko le gaye (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ahl o ayaal bhi das ke qareeb thay to goya aadha khana mehmaanon ke liye hua) Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke hamaray ghar mein koi nahi tha siwae mere baap aur meri maan ke rawi ne kaha ke shayad apni biwi ka bhi kaha aur aik khadim jo mere aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke ghar mein tha Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne raat ka khana Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath khaya phir wahein thehray rahay yahan tak ke Isha ki namaz padhi gayi phir namaz se farigh ho kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas laut gaye aur wahein rahay yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sau gaye gharz bari raat guzarnay ke baad jitni Allah Taala ko manzoor thi Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ghar aaye aur un ki biwi ne kaha ke tum apne mehmaanon ko chhor kar kahan reh gaye thay Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum ne un ko khana nahi khilaya unhon ne kaha ke mehmaanon ne tumharay aanay tak nahi khaya aur unhon ne mehmaanon ke saamnay khana pesh kiya tha lekin mehmaan un par na khanay mein ghalib hue Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein to (Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ki narazgi ke darr se) chhup gaya to unhon ne mujhe pukara ke Ae sust majhool ya ahmaq ! teri naak kate aur mujhe bura kaha aur mehmaanon se kaha ke khao agarchay ye khana khushgawaar nahi hai (kyunke be waqt hai) aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein Allah ki qasam mein us ko kabhi bhi na khaun ga Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ham jo luqma uthatay neechay wo khana itna hi barh jata yahan tak ke ham sair ho gaye aur khana jitna pehle tha us se bhi zyada ho gaya Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne us khanay ko dekha ke wo itna hi hai ya zyada ho gaya hai to unhon ne apni aurat se kaha ke Ae Bani Firaas ki behan (un ka naam Umm Roomaan tha aur Bani Firaas un ka qabeela tha) ye kiya hai wo boli ke meri aankhon ki thandak ki qasam (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki) ke ye to pehle se bhi zyada hai teen hissay zyada hai (ye Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ki karaamat thi us hadees se maloom hua ke auliya se karaamat zaahir ho sakti hai) phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne us mein se khaya aur kaha ke mein ne jo qasam khayi thi wo (ghussay mein) shaitaan ki taraf se thi phir aik luqma us mein se khaya us ke baad wo khana Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas le gaye mein bhi subah ko wahein tha aur hamaray aur aik qaum ke darmiyan aqd tha (yani sulah ka iqraar tha) pas iqraar ki muddat guzar gayi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baara aadmi hamaray afsar kiye aur har aik ke saath log thay aur Allah Taala janta hai ke har aik ke saath kitnay log thay phir wo khana un ke saath kar diya aur sab logon ne us mein se khaya "
"1535","[AI-translation] ´Miqdad raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein aur mere donon saathi aaye aur (faqa waghera ki) takleef se hamari aankhon aur kaanon ki quwwat jati rahi thi ham apne Aap ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab par pesh kartay thay lekin koi hamein qabool na karta tha aakhir ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein apne ghar le gaye wahan teen bakriyan thin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un ka doodh doho ham tum sab peyein ge phir ham un ka doodh doha kartay aur ham mein se har aik apna hissa pi leta aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka hissa rakh chhortay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko tashreef laatay aur aisi aawaz se salam kartay jis se sonay wala na jagay aur jaagnay wala sun le phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid mein aatay namaz padhtay phir apne doodh ke paas aatay aur us ko peetay aik raat jab mein apna hissa pi chuka tha ke shaitaan ne mujhe bharkaaya shaitaan ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam to Ansaar ke paas jatay hain wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko tohfay detay hain aur jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko zaroorat hai mil jata hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us aik ghoont doodh ki kiya zaroorat ho gi aakhir mein aaya aur wo doodh pi gaya jab doodh pait mein sama gaya aur mujhe yaqeen ho gaya ke ab wo doodh nahi milnay ka to us waqt shaitaan ne mujhe nidaamat ki aur kehnay laga ke teri kharaabi ho to ne kiya kaam kiya to ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka hissa pi liya ab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aayein ge aur doodh ko na payein ge to tujh par baddua karein ge aur teri duniya aur aakhirat donon tabah hun gi mein aik chaadar orhay hue tha jab us ko paon par daalta to sar khul jata aur jab sar dhaanpta to paon khul jatay thay aur mujhe neend bhi na aa rahi thi jabke mere saathi sau gaye aur unhon ne ye kaam nahi kiya tha jo mein ne kiya tha aakhir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aaye aur mamool ke muwafiq salam kiya phir masjid mein aaye aur namaz padhi us ke baad doodh ke paas aaye bartan khola to us mein kuch na tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna sar aasmaan ki taraf uthaya mein samjha ke ab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baddua kartay hain aur mein tabah hua Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! khula us ko jo mujhe khulaye aur pila us ko jo mujhe pulaye ye sun kar mein ne apni chaadar ko mazboot baandha chhuri li aur bakriyon ki taraf chala ke jo un mein se moti ho us ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye zabah karun dekha to us ke than mein doodh bhara hua hai phir dekha to aur bakriyon ke thanon mein bhi doodh bhara hua hai mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ghar walon ka aik bartan liya jis mein wo doodh na dohtay thay (yani us mein dohnay ki khwahish nahi kartay thay) us mein mein ne doodh doha yahan tak ke upar jhaag aa gaya (itna bohat doodh nikla) aur mein us ko le kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ne apne hissay ka doodh raat ko piya ya nahi mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap doodh pijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pi kar mujhe diya to mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aur pijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aur piya phir mujhe diya jab mujhe maloom ho gaya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sair ho gaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki dua mein ne le li hai tab mein hansa yahan tak ke khushi ke maaray zameen par gir gaya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Miqdad ! to ne koi buri baat ki wo kiya hai mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mera haal aisa hua aur mein ne aisa qasoor kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us waqt ka doodh (jo khilaf mamool utra) Allah ki rehmat thi to ne mujh se pehle hi kyun na kaha ham apne donon saathiyon ko bhi jaga detay ke wo bhi ye doodh peetay mein ne arz kiya ke qasam us ki jis ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko sacha kalaam de kar bheja hai ke ab mujhe koi parwa nahi jab Aap ne Allah ki rehmat hasil kar li aur mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath hasil ki to koi bhi us ko hasil karay "
"1536","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Umm Maalik raziyallahu anha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aik kuppi mein bataur tohfa ke ghee bheja karti thin phir us ke betay aatay aur us se saalan maango aur ghar mein kuch na hota to Umm Maalik raziyallahu anha us kuppi ke paas jati to us mein ghee hota usi tarah hamesha us ke ghar ka saalan qaim rehta aik baar Umm Maalik ne (hirs kar ke) us kuppi ko nichor liya phir wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aayein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne istifsaar farmaya ke kiya tum ne us ko nichor liya hai unhon ne jawab diya haan to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar to us ko yun hi rehnay deti (aur zaroorat ke waqt leti) to wo hamesha qaim rehta "
"1537","[AI-translation] ´Ubada bin Waleed bin Ubada bin Samit raziyallahu anhu kehtay ke` mein aur mera walid husool ilm ki gharz se qabeela Ansaar ki taraf niklay mubaada ye ke un ka koi fard baaqi na rahay (faut ho jayein ya idhar idhar hijrat kar jayein) Chunanche sab se pehle ham Abu Yasar se milay jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahabi thay un ke saath un ka ghulam bhi tha jo kitabon (khaton) ka aik bandal liye hue tha aur Abu Yasar ke badan par aik chaadar thi aur aik mu'aafiri naami aik kapra tha un ke ghulam par bhi aik chaadar thi aur aik mu'aafiri kapra tha (yani Maalik aur ghulam donon aik hi tarah ka libaas pehnay hue thay) mein ne un se kaha ke Ae chacha Aap kuch ranjeeda maloom hotay hain wo bolay ke Bani haraam qabeelay ke falan bin falan par mera qarz aata tha mein us ke ghar walon ke paas gaya salam kiya aur poocha ke wo shakhs kahan hai unhon ne kaha ke nahi hai itnay mein us ka aik naujawan beta bahar nikla mein ne us se poocha ke tera baap kahan hai wo bola ke Aap ki aawaz sun kar meri maan ke chhappar ghat mein ghus gaya hai tab mein ne aawaz di aur kaha ke Ae falan ! bahar nikal mujhe maloom ho gaya hai ke to kahan hai ye sun kar wo bahar nikla mein ne kaha ke to mujh se chhup kyun raha hai wo bola ke Allah ki qasam mein tum se jhoot nahi bolon ga Allah ki qasam mein dara ke Aap se jhoot baat karun ya waada karun aur us ke khilaf karun aur tum sahabi Rasool ho aur Allah ki qasam mein mohtaaj hun mein ne Allah ki qasam de kar poocha ke kiya tum waaqei mohtaaj ho to us ne Allah ki qasam khayi aur kaha ke mein mohtaaj hun mein ne phir qasam de kar poocha to us ne phir qasam khayi mein ne phir qasam di to us ne phir Allah ki qasam khayi phir us ka waseeqa ya naushta (qarz naama) laya gaya Abu Yasar raziyallahu anhu ne usay apne haath se mita diya aur kaha ke agar tere paas rupiya aaye to ada karna warna to azaad hai pas mein gawahi deta hun meri un donon aankhon ki basaarat ne dekha aur Abu Yasar raziyallahu anhu ne apni donon ungliyan apni aankhon par rakhein aur mere un donon kaanon ne suna aur mere dil ne yaad rakha aur Abu Yasar raziyallahu anhu ne apne dil ki rag ki taraf ishara kiya (aur kaha) ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke jo shakhs kisi tangdast ko mohlat de ya qarz maaf kar de to Allah Taala us ko apne saya mein rakhay ga Ubada ne kaha ke mein ne un se kaha ke Ae chacha agar tum apne ghulam ki chaadar le lo aur apna mu'aafiri kapra us ko de do to tumharay paas bhi aik jora poora ho jaye ga aur us ke paas bhi aik jora ho jaye ga Abu Yasar raziyallahu anhu ne mere sar par haath phera aur kaha ya Allah us larkay ko barkat de Ae mere bhatijay ! meri un donon aankhon ne dekha aur un donon kaanon ne suna aur mere us dil ne yaad rakha aur apne dil ki rag ki taraf ishara kiya (aur kaha) ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke londi aur ghulam ko khulao jo tum khatay ho aur wohi pehnao jo tum pehantay ho phir agar mein us ko duniya ka samaan de dun to wo mere qareeb us se aasaan hai ke wo qayamat ke din meri neki le le Ubada raziyallahu anhu ne kaha phir ham chalay yahan tak ke Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari raziyallahu anhu ke paas un ki masjid mein pahunche wo aik kapra lapaitay hue namaz padh rahay thay mein logon ki gardanein phaalangta hua un ke aur qibla ke darmiyan mein ja baitha mein ne kaha ke Allah Taala Aap par rehem karay Aap aik kapray mein namaz padhtay hain halanke Aap ki (doosri) chaadar Aap ke pehlu mein rakhi hai unhon ne apne haath se mere seenay par us tarah se ishara kiya ungliyon ko kushaada rakhtay hue unhein kamaan ki tarah Khumm kiya aur kaha ke mein ne ye chaha ke teri manind koi ahmaq mere paas aaye phir wo mujhe dekhay jo mein karta hun aur waisa hi karay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamari us masjid mein aaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haath mein bin Taab (khajoor) ki aik chhari thi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne masjid mein qibla ki taraf balgham dekha (kisi ne thooka tha) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko lakri se khurach daalnay phir hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya ke tum mein se kaun ye baat pasand karta hai ke Allah Taala us ki taraf se munh pher le ham ye sun kar darr gaye phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum mein se kaun ye chahta hai ke Allah Taala us ki taraf se munh pher le ham ye sun kar darr gaye phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum mein se kaun ye chahta hai ke Allah Taala us ki taraf se munh pher le ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham mein se to koi bhi ye nahi chahta Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab koi tum mein se namaz mein khara ho to Allah tabaarak o Taala us ke munh ke saamnay hota hai (Nawawi ne kaha yani jihat jis ko Allah Taala ne azmat di ya Kaaba) to apne munh ke saamnay na thookay aur na daahni taraf balke baayein taraf baayein paon ke neechay (thookay) agar balgham jaldi nikalna chahay to apne kapray mein thook kar aisa kar le phir apne kapray ko teh dar teh lapaita us ke baad farmaya ke mere paas khushbu lao hamaray qabeelay ka aik jawan lapka aur daurta hua apne ghar mein gaya aur apni hatheeli mein khushbu le aaya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us khushbu ko lakri ki nok par lagaya aur jahan us balgham ka nishan masjid par tha wahan khushbu laga di Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us hadees se tum apni masjidon mein khushbu rakhtay ho Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath batn Buwaat ki larai mein chalay (wo Juhaina ke paharon mein se aik pahar hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Majdi bin Amr Juhani ki talaash mein thay (jo aik kafir tha) aur ham logon ka ye haal tha ke paanch aur chhe aur saat aadmiyon mein aik oont tha jis par baari baari sawaar hotay thay Chunanche aik Ansari ki baari aayi us ne oont ko bithaya us par charha phir us ko uthaya to oont kuch ura wo Ansari bola ” shaa'i “ (ye kalima hai oont ko daantnay ka) Allah tujh par lanat karay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ye kaun hai jo apne oont par lanat karta hai wo Ansari bola ke mein hun Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us oont par se utar ja aur hamaray saath wo na rahay jis par lanat ki gayi ho apni jaanon apni aulad aur apne maalon ke liye baddua na karo aisa na ho ke ye baddua us sa'at niklay ke jab Allah Taala se kuch maanga jata hai aur wo qabool kar leta hai (to tumhari baddua bhi qabool ho jaye aur tum par aafat aa jaye) Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath chalay jab shaam hui aur Arab ke aik chashmay ke qareeb aaye to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kaun shakhs ham logon se aagay barh kar us hauz ko durust karay ga khud bhi piye aur ham ko bhi pulaye Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein khara hua aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein wo shakhs hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya aur kaun shakhs Jabir ke saath jaye ga Chunanche Jabbaar bin Sakhr uthay khair ham donon aadmi kunwein / chashmay ki taraf chalay aur hauz mein aik ya do dole daalay phir us par mitti lagayi us ke baad us mein pani bharna shuru kiya yahan tak ke labalaab bhar diya sab se pehle ham ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dikhayi diye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum donon (mujhe aur mere janwaron ko pani peenay pilanay ki) ijazat detay ho ham ne arz kiya ” ji haan Ae Allah ke Rasool ! “ Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni oontni ko chhora us ne pani piya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ki baag kheenchi us ne pani pina mauqoof kiya aur peshaab kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ko alag le gaye aur bitha diya us ke baad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hauz ki taraf aaye us mein se wuzu kiya mein bhi khara hua aur jahan se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wuzu kiya tha mein ne bhi wahein se wuzu kiya Jabbaar bin Sakhr raziyallahu anhu qaza-e haajat ke liye chalay gaye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz padhnay ke liye kharay ho gaye mere badan par aik chaadar thi mein us ke donon kinaron ko ultatnay laga wo choti hui us (chaadar) mein phanday lagay thay aakhir mein ne us ko ulta kiya phir us ke donon kinaaray ultay phir us ko apni gardan se baandha us ke baad aa kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baayein taraf khara ho gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mera haath pakra ghumaaya aur daahni taraf khara kar liya phir Jabbaar bin Sakhr aaye unhon ne bhi wuzu kiya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baayein taraf (namaz padhnay ke liye) kharay ho gaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham donon ke haath pakare aur peechay hata diya yahan tak ke ham ko apne peechay khara kiya (maloom hua ke itna amal namaz mein durust hai) phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh ko ghoorna shuru kiya aur mujh ko khabar nahi khabar hui to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne haath se ishara kiya ke apni kamar baandh le (taake satr na khulay) jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz se farigh hue to kaha ke Ae Jabir ! mein ne arz kiya ke haazir hun Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ne farmaya jab chaadar kushaada ho to us ke donon kinaaray ulat le aur jab tang ho to us ko kamar par baandh le Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath chalay aur ham mein se har aik shakhs ko khuraak ke liye har roz aik khajoor milti thi aur wo us ko choos leta tha phir us ko apne daanton mein phirata aur ham apni kamaanon se darakht ke pattay jhaartay aur un ko khatay yahan tak ke (garmi khushki aur pattay khatay khatay) hamaray munh andar se zakhmi ho gaye phir aik din khajoor baantnay wala aik shakhs ko bhool gaya ham us shakhs ko utha kar le gaye aur gawahi di ke us ko khajoor nahi mili baantnay walay ne us ko khajoor di wo khara ho gaya aur khajoor le li phir ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath chalay yahan tak ke aik kushaada waadi mein utray Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam haajat ko tashreef le gaye aik dole pani le kar mein bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay chala gaya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne koi aar na paayi dekha to do darakht waadi ke kinaaray par lagay hue thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik darakht ke paas gaye us ki aik shaakh pakari phir (darakht se) farmaya ke Allah ke hukm se mera taabedaar ho ja wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka taabedaar ho gaya jaisay wo oont jis ki naak mein nakeel daal di jati hai aur wo apne kheenche walay ka taabedaar ho jata hai phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam doosray darakht ke paas gaye aur us ki bhi aik shaakh pakari aur farmaya ke Allah ke hukm se mera taabedaar ho ja wo bhi usi tarah Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke taabe ho gaya yahan tak ke jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un darakhton ke darmiyan mein pahunche to un ko aik saath kar ke farmaya ke Allah ke hukm se mere saamnay jar jao Chunanche wo donon darakht jar gaye Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein daurta hua nikla us darr se ke kahein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mujh ko qareeb dekhein aur zyada door kahein tashreef le jayein mein baitha apne dil mein baatein kiye ja raha tha ke achanak mein ne dekha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam saamnay se tashreef la rahay hain aur wo donon darakht juda ho kar apni jar par kharay ho gaye thay mein ne dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam thori dair kharay hue aur sar se us tarah daayein aur baayein ishara kiya phir saamnay aaye jab mere paas pahunche to farmaya Ae Jabir ! mein jahan khara tha to ne dekha Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya ke ” ji haan Ae Allah ke Rasool ! “ Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum un donon darakhton ke paas jao aur har aik mein se aik aik shaakh kaat kar le aao jab us jagah pahunche jahan mein khara hua tha to aik shaakh apni daahni taraf daal de aur aik daali baayein taraf Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein khara hua aur aik pathar liya us ko tor kar taiz kiya wo taiz ho gaya to un donon darakhton ke paas aaya aur har aik mein se aik aik shaakh kaati phir mein un shaakhon ko kheenchta hua us jagah par le aaya jahan Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam thehray thay aur aik shaakh daahni taraf daal di aur aik shaakh baayein taraf daal di phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ja kar mil gaya aur arz kiya ke jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya tha wo mein ne kar diya lekin us ki wajah kiya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein ne dekha ke wahan do qabrein hain un qabr walon par azaab ho raha hai to mein ne chaha ke un ki sifarish karun jab tak ye shaakhein hari rahein gi shayad un ke azaab mein takhfeef ho Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ham lashkar mein aaye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya Ae Jabir ! logon wuzu ke pani ke liye aawaz lagao mein ne teen dafa aawaz di aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! qaafila mein aik qatra pani ka nahi hai aik Ansari mard tha jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye aik mushk mein jo lakri ki shaakhon par latakti thi pani thanda kiya karta tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us Ansari ke paas jao aur dekho kiya us ki mushk mein kuch pani hai mein gaya dekha to mushk mein pani nahi us ke munh mein sirf aik qatra hai ke agar us ko undailon to sookhi mushk us ko bhi pi le mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us mushk mein to pani nahi hai sirf aik qatra us ke munh mein hai agar mein us ko undailon to sookhi mushk us ko bhi pi jaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya jao aur us mushk ko mere paas le aao mein usi mushk ko le aaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko apne haath mein liya phir zubaan se kuch farmanay lagay jis ko mein samajh na saka aur mushk ko apne haath se dabatay jatay thay phir wo mushk mere hawalay ki aur farmaya ke Ae Jabir aawaz de ke qaafilay ka ghara lao (yani pani wala bara bartan) mein ne aawaz di wo (bartan) laya gaya log us ko utha kar laaye mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay wo bartan rakh diya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna haath us gharay mein pher kar us tarah se phaila kar ungliyon ko kushaada kiya phir apna haath us ki teh mein rakh diya aur farmaya Ae Jabir ! wo mushk le aur mere haath par daal de aur Bism Allah keh kar daalna mein ne Bism Allah keh kar wo pani daal diya phir mein ne dekha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ungliyon ke darmiyan se pani josh maar raha tha yahan tak ke gharay ne josh maara aur ghooma aur bhar gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya Ae Jabir ! aawaz de ke jis ko pani ki haajat ho (wo aaye) Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha log aaye pani liya yahan tak ke sab sair ho gaye mein ne kaha koi aisa bhi raha jis ko pani ki zaroorat ho phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna haath gharay se utha liya aur wo pani se bhara hua tha aur logon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bhook ki shikayat ki Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qareeb hai ke Allah tum ko khulaye phir ham darya (yani samandar) ke kinaaray par aaye samandar ki leher ne josh maara aur aik janwar bahar daal diya ham ne us ke kinaaray aag sulgaayi aur us janwar ka gosht bhoon kar pakaya aur sair ho kar khaya Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir mein aur falan falan paanch aadmi us ki aankh ke gole mein ghus gaye ham ko koi na dekhta tha yahan tak ke ham bahar niklay (itna bara janwar tha) phir ham ne us ki paslion mein se pasli li aur qaafilay mein se us shakhs ko bulaya jo sab se bara tha aur sab se baray oont par sawaar tha aur sab se bara zeen us par tha to wo apna sar jhukaye baghair us pasli ke neechay se guzar gaya (itni oonchi us janwar ki pasli thi beshak Allah apne raah mein nikalnay walon ko deta hai) "
"1538","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Mina mein thay ke chaand phat kar do tukray ho gaya aik tukra to pahar ke us taraf raha aur aik us taraf chala gaya pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke gawah raho "
"1539","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Makka walon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se koi nishani chaahi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein do hisson mein chaand ka phatna dukhaya "
"1540","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Jahl ne kaha ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apna munh tumharay saamnay zameen par rakhtay hain logon ne kaha ke haan Jahl ne kaha ke qasam Laat aur Uzza ki ke agar mein un ko us haal (yani sajda) mein dekhon ga to mein un ki gardan raundon ga ya munh mein mitti lagaun ga phir jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz padh rahay thay wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas us irada se aaya taake Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki gardan raunday to logon ne dekha ke yakayak hi Jahl ultay qadmon phir raha hai aur haath se kisi cheez se bachta hai logon ne poocha ke tujhe kiya hua wo bola ke mein ne dekha ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darmiyan mein aag ki aik Khandaq hai aur khauf hai aur (par) baazu hain (wo farishton ke baazu par thay) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar wo mere qareeb aata to farishtay us ki boti boti uzw uzw uchak letay tab Allah Taala ne ye aayaat utaarein ke ” hargiz nahi aadmi shararat karta hai us wajah se ke apne Aap ko ameer samajhta hai aakhir tujhe tere Rab ki taraf jaana hai kiya to ne us shakhs ko dekha juwa yak banday ko namaz se rokta hai (maazAllah jo kisi Musalman ko namaz se mana karay ya masjid se rokay to wo Jahl jaisa hai) bhala to kiya samajhta hai ke agar ye (Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) seedhi raah par hota aur achi baat ka hukm karta ho to kiya samajhta hai ke agar us ne jhutlaya aur peeth pheri ye nahi janta ke Allah Taala dekh raha hai hargiz nahi agar ye (un buray kaamon se) baaz na aaye ga to ham us ko maathay ke bal ghaseetein ge aur us ka maatha jhoota aur gunahgaar hai wahan wo apni qaum ko pukaaray aur ham farishton ko bulayein ge to hargiz us ka kehna na maan “ (Surah : al-Alaq : 13-6) aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke us ne us ko hukm diya jis ka us ne us ko hukm diya aur aik riwayat mein hai ke pas chahiye ke apni qaum ko pukaaray yani apni qaum ke logon ko "
"1541","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hamraah Najd ki taraf jihad ko gaye to ham ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aik waadi mein paya jahan kaantay daar darakht bohat zyada thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik darakht ke neechay utray aur apni talwaar aik shaakh se latka di aur log us waadi mein alag alag ho kar saya dhoondtay hue phail gaye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aik shakhs mere paas aaya mein sau raha tha ke us ne talwaar utaar li aur mein jaaga to wo mere sar par khara hua tha mujhe us waqt khabar hui jab us ke haath mein nangi talwaar aa gayi thi wo bola ke ab tumhein mujh se kaun bacha sakta hai mein ne kaha ke Allah ! phir doosri baar us ne yehi kaha to mein ne kaha ke Allah Taala ye sun kar us ne talwaar niyaam mein kar li wo shakhs ye baitha hai phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se kuch bhi na kaha "
"1542","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik Yahudya aurat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas zehar mila kar bakri ka gosht layi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us mein se khaya phir wo aurat Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas layi gayi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke ye to ne kiya kiya wo boli ke mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko maar daalna chahti thi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala tujhe itni taqat denay wala nahi (ke to us ke paighambar ko halaak kar sakay) sahaba raziyallahu anhum ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham us ko qatl na kar dein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke nahi (ye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka us par rehem tha aur us se ye bhi nikalta hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam paighambar barhaq thay warna agar baadshah hotay to us aurat ko qatl karatay) rawi ne kaha ke mein hamesha us zehar ka asar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke halaq ke koe mein pata raha "
"1543","[AI-translation] ´Abu Humaid raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Tabook ki jang (ghazwa Tabook) mein ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath niklay waadi ul Qura (shaam ke rastay mein Madina se teen meel ke faaslay par aik muqaam hai) mein aik aurat ke baagh ke paas pahunche to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke andaza lagao us baagh mein kitna mewa hai ham ne andaza kiya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ke andazay mein wo das wasq maloom hua Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us aurat se farmaya ke jab tak ham laut kar aayein tum ye (andaza) ginti yaad rakhna agar Allah ne chaha phir ham log aagay chalay yahan tak ke Tabook mein pahunche Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aaj raat taiz aandhi chalay gi lihaza koi shakhs khara na ho aur jis ke paas oont ho wo us ko mazbooti se baandh le phir aisa hi hua ke zordaar aandhi chali aik shakhs khara hua to us ko hua ura le gayi aur (waadi) tay ke donon paharon ke darmiyan daal diya bin al-ulama haakim Aila ka ailchi aik khat le kar aaya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye aik safed khachar tohfa laya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko jawab likha aur aik chaadar tohfa bheji phir ham lautay yahan tak ke waadi ul Qura mein pahunche Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us aurat se baagh ke maiway ka haal poocha ke kitna nikla us ne kaha poora das wasq nikla (phir) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein jaldi jaun ga lihaza tum mein se jis ka dil chahay wo mere saath jaldi chalay aur jis ka dil chahay thehar jaye ham niklay yahan tak ke Madina dekhayi denay laga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye ” Taaba “ hai (Taaba Madina Munawwara ka naam hai) aur ye Uhud pahar hai jo ham ko chahta hai aur ham us ko chahtay hain phir farmaya ke Ansaar ke gharon mein Bani Najjar ke ghar behtareen hain (kyunke wo sab se pehle Musalman hue) phir Bani Abdul Ashhal ke ghar phir Bani Haris bin Khazraj ke ghar phir Bani Sa'ida ke ghar aur Ansaar ke sab gharon mein behtari hai phir Sa'd bin Ubada raziyallahu anhu ham se milay Abu Usaid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum ne nahi suna ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ansaar ke gharon ki behtari bayan farmayi to ham ko sab ke aakhir mein kar diya ye sun kar Sa'd raziyallahu anhu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se milay aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap ne Ansaar ki fazeelat bayan ki aur ham ko sab se aakhir mein kar diya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tum ko ye kaafi nahi hai ke tum achhon mein rahay "
"1544","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ke meri misaal us shakhs ki si hai jis ne aag Jalayi jab us ke gird roshani hui to us mein keeray aur ye janwar jo aag mein hain girnay lagay aur wo shakhs un ko roknay laga lekin wo na ruke aur us mein girnay lagay ye misaal hai meri aur tumhari mein tumhari kamar pakar kar jahannam se rokta hun aur kehta hun ke jahannam ke paas se chalay aao aur tum nahi maantay usi mein ghuse jatay ho "
"1545","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik kaam mein rukhsat rawa rakhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko maloom hua to khutba padhnay ko kharay hue aur farmaya ke logon ka kiya haal hai ke jis kaam mein mujhe rukhsat di gayi hai us se ehtiraaz kartay hain Allah ki qasam mein to sab se zyada Allah Taala ko janta hun aur sab se zyada Allah Taala se darta hun (to meri pairwi karna aur meri raah par chalna yehi taqwa aur parhezgaari hai aur befaida nafs par baar daalna aur jaaiz kaam se bachna us ke jaaiz honay mein shak karna hai)"
"1546","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko (Allah Taala ki taraf se) do kaamon ka ikhtiyar diya gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aasaan ko ikhtiyar kiya basharteke wo gunah na ho aur jo gunah hota to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sab se barh kar us se door rehtay aur kabhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni zaat ke liye kisi se badla nahi liya albatta agar koi Allah ke hukm ke barkhilaaf karta to us ko saza detay "
"1547","[AI-translation] ´Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz padhi yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paon sooj gaye logon ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kyun itni takleef uthatay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke to aglay aur pichlay sab gunah bakhsh diye gaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya mein Allah ka shukarguzaar banda na binon "
"1548","[AI-translation] ´Jundub raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke mein hauz kausar par tumhara pesh khema hun ga (yani aagay ja kar tumhara muntazir hun ga aur tumharay pilanay ka samaan durust karun ga) "
"1549","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ke mera hauz aik maheena ke safar ke barabar hai us ke chaaron konay barabar hain (yani tool aur arz yaksaan hai) us ka pani chaandi se zyada safed hai aur us ki khushbu mushk se behtar hai us par jo aabkhoray (pyaalay) rakhay hain un ki ginti aasmaan ke taaron ke barabar hai jo us mein se piye ga phir kabhi pyaasa na ho ga Abdullah ne kaha ke Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein hauz par rahun ga aur dekhon ga ke tum mein se kaun kaun wahan aatay hain aur kuch log mere paas aanay se rokay jayein ge to mein kahun ga ke Ae Rab ! ye log mere hain meri ummat ke hain to jawab milay ga ke tumhein nahi maloom ke jo kaam unhon ne tumharay baad kiye Allah ki qasam tumharay baad zara na thehray aur airiyon par laut gaye (Islam se phir gaye un logon mein khariji bhi daakhil hain jo Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath se alag ho gaye aur Musalmanon ko kafir samajhnay lagay aur wo log bhi daakhil hain jinhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wasiyat par amal na kiya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ahl bait ko sataaya aur shaheed kiya maazAllah) bin Abu Mulaika (rawi hadees) kehtay hain ke Ae Allah ham airiyon par laut janay se ya deen mein fitna honay se teri panah maango hain "
"1550","[AI-translation] ´Harisa bin Wahb raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mera hauz itna bara hai jaisay San'a se Madina (aik maheena ki raah) Mustaurid ne kaha ke tum ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bartanon ka zikr nahi suna Harisa ne kaha ke nahi Mustaurid ne kaha ke wahan sitaaron ki tarah bartan hun ge "
"1551","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tumharay saamnay aik hauz ho ga jis ke donon kinaron mein itna faasla ho ga jaisay Jarba aur Azruh mein hai aik riwayat mein hai ke tumharay saamnay mera hauz ho ga aur aik riwayat mein hai Ubaidullah kehtay hain ke mein ne un se (yani Nafi se) poocha ke Jarba aur Azruh kiya hain to unhon ne kaha ke shaam mein do gaon hain aur un mein teen raat ki masaafat ka faasla hai aik aur riwayat mein hai ke teen din ki masaafat hai "
"1552","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein hauz par tumhara pesh khema hun ga aur us ke donon kinaron mein itna faasla hai jaisay San'a aur Aila mein aur us ke aabkhoray taaron ki tarah hain "
"1553","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mein ne kaha ke` Ae Allah ke Rasool ! hauz ke bartan kaisay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai us hauz ke bartan aasmaan ke taaron se zyada hain aur raat wo jo andheri be badali ke ho wo jannat ke bartan hain jo us hauz se (pani) pi le ga wo phir hamesha tak kabhi pyaasa na ho ga (yani jannat mein janay tak) us hauz mein jannat ke do parnaalay batay hain jo us mein se piye ga wo pyaasa na ho ga aur us ka tool aur arz barabar hai jitna faasla Aila se Umaan tak hai (ye donon shaam ke sheher hain) us ka pani doodh se zyada safed aur shehed se zyada meetha hai "
"1554","[AI-translation] ´Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein apne hauz ke kinaaray par logon ko hatata hun ga Yaman walon ke liye mein apni lakri se maaron ga yahan tak ke Yaman walon par us ka pani beh aaye ga (us se Yaman walon ki bari fazeelat nikli unhon ne duniya mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki madad ki aur dushmanon se bachaya pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi aakhirat mein un ki madad karein ge aur sab se pehle hauz kausar se wo peyein ge) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha gaya ke us hauz ka arz kitna hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jaisay yahan se Umaan phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha gaya ke us ka pani kaisa hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke doodh se zyada safed hai aur shehed se zyada meetha hai do parnaalay us mein pani chhortay hain jin ko jannat se pani ki madad hoti hai aik parnaala sonay ka hai aur aik chaandi ka "
"1555","[AI-translation] ´Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik din niklay aur shuhada Uhud par namaz janaza padhi phir mimbar ki taraf aaye aur farmaya ke mein tumhara pesh khema hun ga aur gawah hun ga aur Allah ki qasam mein us waqt hauz kausar ko dekh raha hun aur mujhe zameen ke khazaanon ki chaabiyaan milein ya zameen ki chaabiyaan aur Allah ki qasam mujhe ye darr nahi ke tum mere baad mushrik ho jao ge balke ye darr hai ke tum duniya ke laalach mein aa kar aik doosray se hasad karnay lago "
"1556","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na bohat lambay thay na bohat chotay qad ke na bilkul safed thay na bilkul gandumi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baal na bilkul sakht ghungriyaalay thay na bilkul seedhay Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko chaalees saal ki Umar mein nabuwwat se sarfaraz kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam das baras Makka mein rahay aur das baras Madina mein aur saathwein baras ke aakhir mein Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko utha liya (to) us waqt Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sar aur daarhi mubarak mein bees baal bhi safed na thay "
"1557","[AI-translation] ´Bara (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam darmiyane qad ke thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke donon mondhon mein zyada faasla tha (yani seena chaura tha) baal bohat thay kaanon ki lo tak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam surkh jora pehantay (yani jis mein surkh aur zard lakeerein thin) mein ne kisi ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zyada khoobsurat nahi dekha "
"1558","[AI-translation] ´Abu Tufail raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha aur ab zameen par siwa mere Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekhnay walon mein koi nahi raha (rawi hadees Jariri) kehtay hain ke mein ne un se kaha ke Aap ne dekha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kaisay thay unhon ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam safed rang thay namkeeni ke saath aur miyaana qad mutawaazin jism ke thay Imam Muslim ne kaha ke Abu Tufail 100 h mein faut hue aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab mein sab ke baad wohi faut hue "
"1559","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sar aur daarhi ka aagay ka hissa safed ho gaya tha jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tail daaltay to safedi maloom na hoti aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki daarhi bohat ghani thi aik shakhs bola ke kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka chehra mubarak talwaar ki tarah yani lamba tha Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka chehra mubarak sooraj aur chaand ki tarah aur gol tha aur mein ne nabuwwat ki mahar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke kandhay par dekhi jaisay kabootar ka anda hota hai aur us ka rang jism ke rang se milta tha "
"1560","[AI-translation] ´Saib bin Yazid raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` meri khala mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas le gayi aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mera bhaanja bohat beemar hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere sar par haath phera aur barkat ki dua ki phir wuzu kiya to mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke wuzu ka bacha hua pani pi liya phir mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki peeth ke peechay khara hua aur mein ne nabuwwat ki mahar donon mondhon ke darmiyan mein dekhi jaisay ghundi chhappar kat ki (ya hajla aik janwar hai us ke anday ki tarah thi) "
"1561","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Sarjas raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath roti gosht ya sareed khaya (rawi hadees Aasim) kehtay hain ke mein ne Abdullah raziyallahu anhu se poocha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tumharay liye bakhshish ki dua ki unhon ne kaha haan aur tere liye bhi phir ye aayat padhi ke ” bakhshish maang apne gunah ki aur momin mardon aur momin auraton ke gunah ki “ Abdullah raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke phir mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay gaya to mein ne donon kandhon ke darmiyan mein chalni haddi ke paas kandhay ke qareeb mahar nabuwwat dekhi wo band mutthi ki tarah thi aur us par mason ki tarah til thay "
"1562","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka dahan kushaada tha (kyunke mardon ke liye dahan ki kushaadgi umda hai aur auraton ke liye buri hai) aankhon mein surkh doray chotay hue aur airiyaan kam gosht wali thin Simaak se (Shuba ne) poocha ke ” zalee'ul al-fam “ kiya hai to unhon ne kaha ke bara chehra phir (Shuba) ne kaha ” ashkal al-ain “ kiya hai to unhon ne kaha lambi shigaaf aankhon ke (lekin Simaak ka ye kehna ghalat hai aur sahih wohi hai ke safedi mein surkhi mili hui) Shuba ne kaha ” manhoos al-aqibain “ kiya hai to unhon ne kaha airee par kam gosht walay "
"1563","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) riwayat kartay hain ke` sar aur daarhi ke safed baal ukhairna makrooh hai aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khizaab nahi kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki choti daarhi mein jo neechay ke hont talay hoti hai kuch safedi thi aur kuch kanpatiyon par aur sar mein kahein kahein safed baal thay "
"1564","[AI-translation] ´Abu Juhaifa raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka rang safed tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam boorhay ho gaye thay aur Hasan bin Ali raziyallahu anhu Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke mushaabeh thay "
"1565","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baal kandhon ke qareeb tak thay "
"1566","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baal aadhay kaanon tak thay "
"1567","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ahl kitab yani Yahud aur Nasaara apne baalon ko peshani par lataktay hue chhor detay thay (yani maang nahi nikaaltay thay) aur mushrik maang nikaaltay thay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ahl kitab ke tareeq par chalna dost rakhtay thay jis masala mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko koi hukm na hota (yani ba nisbat mushrikeen ke ahl kitab behtar hain to jis baab mein koi hukm na aata Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ahl kitab ki muwaafaqat us masalay mein ikhtiyar kartay) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi peshani par baal latakanay lagay us ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam maang nikaalnay lagay "
"1568","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mein us kunwari larki se jo parday mein rehti hai zyada sharam thi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab kisi cheez ko bura jantay to ham us ki nishani Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke chehray se pehchan letay thay "
"1569","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka rang mubarak safed chamakta hua tha (Nawawi ne kaha ke ye rang sab rangon se umda hai) aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka paseena mubarak mauti ki tarah tha aur jab chaltay to (pasinay ke qatray daayein baayein idhar idhar jhukay jatay thay jaisay kashti jhukti jati hai) aur mein ne deebaaj aur hareer bhi itna narm nahi paya jitni Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hatheeli narm thi aur mein ne mushk aur ambar mein bhi wo khushbu na paayi jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke jism mubarak mein thi "
"1570","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Zohar ki namaz padhi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne ghar janay ko niklay aur mein bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath nikla saamnay kuch bachay aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne har aik bachay ke rukhsaar par haath phera aur mere rukhsaar par bhi haath phera mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haath mein wo thandak aur wo khushbu dekhi jaisay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khushbu saaz ke dibba mein se haath nikala ho "
"1571","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par sardi ke dinon mein bhi wahi utarti to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki peshani se (wahi ki sakhti se) paseena beh nikalta tha "
"1572","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Haris bin Hisham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi kaisay aati hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kabhi to aisi aati hai jaisay ghanti ki jhankaar aur wo mujh par nihayat sakht hoti hai phir jab poori ho jati hai to mein yaad kar chuka hota hun aur kabhi aik farishta mard ki soorat mein aata hai aur jo wo kehta hai mein us ko yaad kar leta hun "
"1573","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray ghar mein tashreef laaye aur aaraam farmaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko paseena aaya meri maan aik sheeshi layi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka paseena poonchh poonchh kar us mein daalnay lagi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aankh khul gayi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Umm Sulaim ye kiya kar rahi ho wo boli ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka paseena hai jis ko ham apni khushbu mein shaamil kartay hain aur wo sab se barh kar khud khushbu hai "
"1574","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Umm Sulaim ke ghar mein jatay aur un ke bichhonay par sau rehtay aur wo ghar mein nahi hotein thin aik din Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye aur un ke bichhonay par sau rahay logon ne unhein bila kar kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tumharay ghar mein tumharay bichhonay par sau rahay hain ye sun kar wo aayein dekha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko paseena aaya hua hai aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka paseena chamray ke bichhonay par jama ho gaya hai Umm Sulaim ne apna dibba khola aur ye paseena poonchh poonchh kar sheeshon mein bharnay lagein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ghabra kar uth baithay aur farmaya ke Ae Umm Sulaim ! kiya karti hai unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham apne bachon ke liye barkat ki umeed rakhtay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ne theek kiya "
"1575","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam subah ki namaz padhtay to muddinay ke khadim apne bartanon mein pani le kar aatay phir jo bhi bartan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aata Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apna haath us mein dubo detay aur kabhi sardi ke din mein bhi ittifaaq hota to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam haath dubo detay "
"1576","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha aur hajjaam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka sar bana raha tha aur sahaba raziyallahu anhum Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke gird thay wo chahtay thay ke koi baal zameen par na gire balke kisi na kisi ke haath mein gire "
"1577","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik aurat ki aqal mein thora paagal pan tha us ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaam hai (yani kuch kehna hai jo logon ke saamnay nahi keh sakti) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Umm falan ! (yani us ka naam liya) to jahan chahay gi mein tera kaam kar dun ga phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne rastay mein us se tanhayi ki yahan tak ke wo apni baat se farigh ho gayi "
"1578","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne kisi ko bachon par itni shafqat kartay nahi dekha jitni Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kartay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saahibzaday Ibrahim (Madina ke Awaali mein) doodh peetay thay (Awaali Madina ke paas kuch gaon thay) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jaya kartay aur ham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath hotay phir us ke ghar tashreef le jatay wahan dhoaan hota tha kyunke ” Anna “ ka shohar lohaar tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bachay ko letay pyaar kartay aur phir laut aatay Amr ne kaha ke jab Ibrahim ne wafaat paayi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ibrahim mera beta hai us ne doodh peetay mein wafaat paayi ab us ko do Annaaein (daaiyaan) mili hain jo jannat mein us ke doodh peenay ki muddat tak doodh pilayein gi "
"1579","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Aqra bin Haabis ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Hasan raziyallahu anhu ko bosa detay hue dekha to wo bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mere das bachay hain mein ne un mein se kisi ko bosa nahi diya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo (bachon aur yateemon aur aajizon aur zaeefon par) rehem na karay Allah Taala bhi us par rehem na karay ga "
"1580","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam safar mein thay aur aik Habshi ghulam jis ka naam Anjasha tha hadi gata tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Anjasha ! aahista aahista chal aur oonton ko sheeshay laday hue oonton ki tarah haank "
"1581","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sab logon se zyada khoobsurat sab se zyada sakhi aur sab se zyada bahaadur thay aik raat Madina walon ko (kisi dushman ke aanay ka) khauf hua to jidhar se aawaz aa rahi thi log idhar chalay to rastay mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko laut-tay hue paya (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon se pehle akelay khabar lenay ko tashreef le gaye hue thay) aur sab se pehle Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aawaz ki taraf tashreef le gaye thay aur Talha ke ghoray ki nangi peeth par sawaar thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke galay mein talwaar thi aur farmatay thay ke kuch darr nahi kuch darr nahi ye ghora to darya hai aur pehle wo ghora sust tha (ye bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka muajiza tha ke wo taiz ho gaya) "
"1582","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sab logon se zyada achay akhlaaq ke Maalik thay aik din Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe aik kaam par janay ko kaha to mein ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein nahi jaun ga lekin mere dil mein yehi tha ke jis kaam ke liye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hukm detay hain jaun ga (larakpan ke qaa'iday par mein ne zaahir mein inkar kiya) aakhir mein nikla yahan tak ke mujhe larkay milay jo bazaar mein khail rahay thay (ghaaliban wahan tak kar un ko dekhnay lagay aur kaam se dair ho gayi) yakayak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne peechay se aa kar meri gardan thaam li mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf dekha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hans rahay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Unees ! (ye tasgheer hai Anas ki pyaar se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya) to wahan gaya jahan mein ne hukm diya tha mein ne kaha ke ji haan Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein jata hun Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein ne no baras tak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki khidmat ki mujhe yaad nahi ke kisi kaam ke liye jis ko mein ne kiya ho to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye farmaya ke to ne aisa kyun kiya ya kisi kaam ko mein ne na kiya ho aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ho ke kyun nahi kiya "
"1583","[AI-translation] ´Urwa bin Zubair kehtay hain ke` Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) bayan kartay thay aur kehtay thay ke sun Ae hujra wali sun Ae hujra wali aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) namaz padhti thin jab namaz padh chukein to unhon ne Urwa se kaha ke tum ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ki baatein sunein (itni dair mein unhon ne kitni hadeesein bayan kein) aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us tarah se baat kartay thay ke ginnay wala us ko chahta to gin leta (yani thehar thehar kar aahista se aur yehi tehzeeb hai char char aur jaldi jaldi baatein karna aqalmandi aur daanayi ka shewa nahi) "
"1584","[AI-translation] ´Shaffeeq bin Wail kehtay hain ke` Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) hamein har Jumeraat ko waz sunaya kartay thay aik shakhs bola ke Ae Abu Abdur Rahman ! (ye Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ki kunniyat hai) ham tumhari guftagu (sunna) chahtay hain aur pasand kartay hain ham ye chahtay ke tum hamein har roz hadees sunaya karo Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein tum ko jo har roz hadees nahi sunata to us wajah se ke tumhein uktaahat mein daal dena bura janta hun aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kai dinon mein koi din muqarrar kartay thay us liye ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein ranj dena bura jantay thay (yani baar hona) "
"1585","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sab logon se zyada maal denay mein sakhi thay aur sab waqton se zyada Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sakhaawat Ramazan ke maheena mein hoti thi aur Jibrail alaihissalam har saal Ramazan mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se miltay to aakhir maheena tak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam unhein Quran sunatay jab Jibrail alaihissalam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se miltay us waqt Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam maal ke denay mein chalti hua se bhi zyada taizi se sakhaawat kartay thay (maloom hua ke mubarak maheena aur mubarak waqt mein zyada sakhaawat karna chahiye) "
"1586","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aisa kabhi nahi hua ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se koi cheez maangi gayi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nahi keh diya ho "
"1587","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se donon paharon ke baich ki bakriyan maangein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko de dein wo apni qaum ke paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae logon ! Musalman ho jao Allah ki qasam Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tohfa detay hain ke mohtaaji ka darr bhi nahi kartay Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke aik shakhs mehz duniya ke liye Musalman hota tha phir wo aisa Musalman ho jata yahan tak ke Islam us ke qareeb saari duniya se zyada mehbub ho jata (pehle to laalach mein Musalman hua tha magar baad mein mukhlis ho gaya) "
"1588","[AI-translation] ´bin Shihab se riwayat hai bayan kartay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ghazwa fatah Makka ke mauqa par jihad kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne saath Musalmanon ko le kar niklay aur Hunain mein larai ki to Allah Taala ne apne deen aur Musalmanon ki nusrat farmayi us din Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (maal ghaneemat se) Safwan bin Umayya ko sau oont diye phir 100 oont diye phir 100 oont diye bin Shihab kehtay hain ke mujhe Sa'eed bin Musayyab ne bayan kiya ke Safwan ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe jo kuch diya diya aur (us se qabal) meri nigaah mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sab se zyada buray thay phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamesha mujhe detay rahay hatta ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam meri nigaah mein sab logon se zyada mehbub ho gaye "
"1589","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : agar hamaray paas Bahrain ka maal aaye ga to mein tujhe itna itna aur itna dun ga aur donon haathon se ishara kiya (yani teen lap bhar kar) phir Bahrain ka maal aanay se pehle Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ho gayi wo maal Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ke paas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baad aaya to unhon ne aik munaadi ko ye aawaz karnay ke liye hukm diya ke jis ke liye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kuch waada kiya ho ya us ka qarz Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par aata ho wo aaye ye sun kar mein khara hua aur kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se waada kiya tha ke agar Bahrain ka maal aaye ga to tujh ko itna itna aur itna dein ge ye sun kar Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ne aik lap bhara phir mujh se kaha ke us ko gin mein ne guna to wo paanch sau niklay Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us ka dogna aur le le (to teen lap ho gaye) "
"1590","[AI-translation] ´Jubair bin Mut'im raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mere kai naam hain mein Muhammad Ahmed aur Maahi yani meri wajah se Allah Taala kufr ko mitaye ga aur mein Haashir hun log mere paas qayamat ke din shafaat ke liye ikathay hun ge aur mein Aaqib hun yani mere baad koi paighambar nahi hai aur Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka naam Ra'oof aur Raheem rakha (bohat narm aur bohat meharban) (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) "
"1591","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne kai naam ham se bayan kartay thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hun aur Ahmed aur Muqaffi (yani Aaqib) aur Haashir aur Nabi Tauba aur Nabi muamlay (kyunke tauba aur rehmat ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne saath le kar aaye) "
"1592","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka mein tehra baras tak rahay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi utra karti thi aur Madina mein das baras tak rahay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tirsath baras ki Umar mein wafaat paayi "
"1593","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka mein pandra baras tak (farishton ki) aawaz suntay thay aur (farishton ki ya Allah ki aayaat ki) roshani dekhtay thay saat baras tak lekin koi soorat nahi dekhtay thay phir aath baras tak wahi aaya karti thi aur das baras tak Madina mein rahay (ye riwayat shaaz hai) "
"1594","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tirsath baras ki Umar mein wafaat hui aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ki bhi tirsath baras mein wafaat hui aur Umar raziyallahu anhu ki bhi tirsath baras ki Umar mein wafaat hui "
"1595","[AI-translation] ´Ammar maula Bani Hashim kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha ke jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat hui to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kitnay baras ke thay unhon ne kaha ke mein nahi samajhta tha ke tum Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki qaum se ho kar itni baat na jantay ho ge mein ne kaha ke mein ne logon se poocha to unhon ne us mein ikhtilaf kiya pas mujhe us baaray mein Aap ka qaul sunna behtar maloom hua Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke tum hisab jantay ho mein ne kaha ke haan to unhon ne kaha ke chaalees baras ko yaad rakho ke us waqt Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam paighambar hue ab pandra aur joro ke jab tak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka mein rahay kabhi aman ke saath aur kabhi darr ke saath ab das aur joro jo Madina mein hijrat ke baad guzray (to sab mila kar painsath baras hotay hain) aur us se pehle Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees guzar chuki hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne saath baras ki Umar mein wafaat paayi (dekhyie hadees : 1556) "
"1596","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Allah Azza wa Jal jab kisi ummat par rehem karta hai to us ka Nabi ummat ki halaakat se pehle faut ho jata hai aur wo apni ummat ka pesh khema hota hai aur jab kisi ummat ki tabahi chahta hai to us ko Nabi ke saamnay halaak karta hai aur un ki halaakat se Nabi ki aankh ko thanda kar deta hai kyunke wo (ummat) us ko jhutlaanay wali aur us ke ehkaam ki nafarmani karnay wali hoti hai "
"1597","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Ansaar ke aik aadmi ne Zubair raziyallahu anhu (jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke phuphi zaad bhai thay) se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas (muqaam) Harra ke mohray mein jhagra kiya (Harra kehtay hain kaalay pathar wali zameen ko) jis se khajoor ke darakhton ko pani detay thay Ansari ne kaha ke pani ko chhor de ke bata rahay Zubair ne inkar kiya aakhir sab ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay jhagra kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Zubair se farmaya ke Ae Zubair ! to (apne darakhton ko) pani pila le phir pani ko apne hamsaye ki taraf chhor de ye sun kar Ansari ghussa hua aur kehnay laga ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Zubair Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke phuphi ke betay thay (us wajah se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ki riayat ki) ye sun kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke chehray mubarak ka rang badal gaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Zubair ! apne darakhton ko pani pila phir pani ko rok le yahan tak ke wo munderon tak charh jaye Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein samajhta hun ke ye aayat usi baaray mein naazil ke ” Allah ki qasam wo momin na hun ge jab tak tujh ko apne jhagron mein haakim na banayein ge phir jo to faisla kar de us se ranj na karein aur maan lein “ ((poori aayat falaawwar bik la yuminoon hatta yuhakkimook)) "
"1598","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne ashaab ki koi baat suni (jo buri thi) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khutba padha aur farmaya ke mere saamnay jannat aur dozakh layi gayi aur mein ne aaj ki si behtari aur aaj ki si burayi kabhi nahi dekhi (yani jannat mein nematein aur dozakh mein azaab) agar tum wo kuch jantay jo mein janta hun to albatta tum log kam hanstay aur bohat zyada rotay Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab raziyallahu anhum par us din se zyada koi sakht din nahi guzra unhon ne apne saron ko chhupa liya aur ronay ki aawaz un se nikalnay lagi phir Umar raziyallahu anhu kharay hue aur kaha ke ham Allah Taala ke Rab honay par Islam ke deen honay par aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Nabi honay par raazi ho gaye aik shakhs utha aur kehnay laga ke mera baap kaun tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tera baap falan shakhs tha (us ka naam bata diya) tab ye aayat naazil hui ke ” Ae iman walo ! aisi baatein mat poocho ke agar wo zaahir hun to tum ko buri lagein “ "
"1599","[AI-translation] ´Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Musalmanon mein se sab se bara qasoor us Musalman ka hai jis ne wo baat poochi jo Musalmanon par haraam na thi lekin us ke poochnay ki wajah se haraam ho gayi "
"1600","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` aik aadmi ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mera baap kahan hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke dozakh mein jab wo peeth mor kar chala to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko bulwaya aur farmaya ke mera baap aur tera baap donon jahannam mein hain "
"1601","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai bayan kartay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye farmatay hue suna ke mein tumhein jis cheez se rok dun us se ruk jao aur jis ke karnay ka hukm dun usay apni istitaat ke mutaabiq baja lao pas siwae us ke nahi ke tum se pehli aqwaam ko un ke kasrat sawal aur ambiya par ikhtilaf karnay ne halaak kar diya "
"1602","[AI-translation] ´Talha bin Ubaidullah raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath kuch logon ke paas se guzra jo khajoor ke darakhton ke paas thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye log kiya kar rahay hain logon ne arz kiya ke paiwand lagatay hain yani nar ko maada mein rakhtay hain ke wo gaabha ho jati hai (yani zyada phal lati hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein samajhta hun ke us mein kuch faida nahi hai ye khabar un logon ko pahunchi to unhon ne paiwand karna chhor diya us ke baad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye khabar pahunchi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar us mein un ko faida hai to wo karein mein ne to aik khayal kiya tha to mere khayal ko na lo lekin jab mein Allah Taala ki taraf se koi hukm bayan karun to us par amal karo us liye ke mein Allah Taala par jhoot bolnay wala nahi hun "
"1603","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai aik zamana aisa aaye ga jab tum mujhe dekh na sako ge aur mera dekhna tumhein tumharay baal bachon aur apne maal se zyada azeez ho ga (us liye meri sohbat ghaneemat samjho zindagi ka aitbaar nahi aur deen ki baatein jald seekh lo) Ishaq (yani bin Muhammad bin Sufyan) ne kaha ke mere qareeb us ka maani ye hai ” lan yaraani ma'ahum “ ka matlab mein ye samajhta hun ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka deedaar muqaddam ho ga aur us ibaarat mein taqdeem o takheer hai "
"1604","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : meri ummat mein bohat chaahnay walay mere wo log hun ge jo mere baad paida hun ge un mein se koi ye khwahish rakhay ga ke Kaash apne ghar walon aur maal sab ko qurban karay aur mujhe dekh le "
